WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.039
Whatup my bruthas and sistas? This week we
vowin to vanquish the villainous voice of

00:00:14.039 --> 00:00:17.979
the oppressor by venerating V for Vendetta
by Alan Moore.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:28.640
It's November 5th 1997 and it sho' do suck
to live in England. In the late 1980s an all-out

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:34.220
nuclear war busted out, people started gettin'
scurred like they do, and voted in a fascist

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.830
government full or racist-ass honkies called
Norsefire.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:42.360
Ever since then, the government got errybody by the balls.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:47.240
Peep 16 year old Evey Hammond, fo' instance.
Girl so cashed out dat she gotta turn tricks

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.140
on the street just to get by.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:52.640
One night, some
secret po-lice cats called "The Finger" start

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:58.100
gettin' rough with Evey and even bout to ghost
a girl when BAM- a badass mutha rockin' a

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:04.520
Guy Fawkes mask jumps dem bitches and saves
Evie. This true blue anarchist go by the name of V-

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:09.740
and he keep it 100 erry day plottin
to burn NorseFire to the GROUND.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.480
How real do he keep it?

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:16.400
Well, after saving Evie, he
blow up the Parliament building like he don't give a F#ck.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:20.040
Then, he take her back to his
Batcave, called The Shadow Galley.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:25.460
Meanwhile, there be this old school detective
name Finch who tryna bring the heat down on V.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:31.220
Dude got all the government big-wigs in
his posse- including the top dawg himself-Adam Susan,

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.740
who spend most of his time chillin'
with "Fate";

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.680
a computer that pretty much controls errything

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:42.110
Apparently, V been HUSTLIN' lately- mercin'
haters left n' right: a paedo peacher-man

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:47.660
named Lilliman, some radio jockey asshole
named Prothero, and a doc named Surridge.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:52.630
Finch eventually realize that all these homies
connected- they all used to work at a government

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:57.970
"resettlement camp" called Larkhill where
peeps got experimented on and tortured.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:03.440
V was one of the victims- he supposedly had
a psychotic breakdown, busted shit up, and

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:08.629
bounced on outta there. Now it looks like
brutha is on a gnarly revenge grind.

00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:14.370
Months later, V busts in to the propaganda
building head up by a shyster named Dascombe,

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:19.579
and broadcasts a message to erryone preachin
that things gotta CHANGE, and they ain't gonna

00:02:19.579 --> 00:02:24.709
unless people step up and buck the system.
V pulls some sick moves escaping from the

00:02:24.709 --> 00:02:27.599
building, and Dascomb gets capped in the process.

00:02:27.599 --> 00:02:32.659
Meanwhile, things might be lookin' up for
Evie- fo' a little while, at least. Evie left

00:02:32.659 --> 00:02:37.319
the Shadow Gallery and is shackin' up with
this old dude name Gordon. But when her boy

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:43.010
toy gets shanked, Evey gets fed up with this
shitty world and try to strap up and serve

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:48.189
up some street justice. But befo' she do,
girl gets GOT and thrown in the can.

00:02:48.189 --> 00:02:53.540
While she wastin away in her solo cell, Evey
finds some letters written by Valerie Page,

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:58.140
an actress who got locked up, tortured, and
eventually killed for being gay.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:03.820
Val went out like a real G, tho. She kept showin' da
world love and refused to give in.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:10.260
Evey reads dat letter over and over. Evie's captors roll
in and tell her to cooperate or die.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:14.620
But Evie wanna keep it clutch 
like Valerie did, and tells 'em where to stick it.

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:19.100
Thinkin she bout to get glocked, she surprised
as fuck when somebody roll up and be like

00:03:19.109 --> 00:03:25.059
"You FREE girl!" Huh? Turns out dis whole
prison-torture scenario was a big play put

00:03:25.059 --> 00:03:28.259
on by V who was tryna set Evey free from fear,

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.560
which is da REAL prison 
that been keepin her down her whole life.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:38.980
Anyway, while she was gone, V did some next-level
hackin- fool busted in to the Fate computer system

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.920
and been usin it to play mind games
with Adam Susan,

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:45.300
makin' him slowly lose his damn mind

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:50.359
Afta' a while, Finch's boy Dominic
figgers out da reason V able to ball so hard

00:03:50.359 --> 00:03:52.669
is cuz he hooked up to the fate computer.

00:03:52.669 --> 00:03:57.609
On the next 5th of November, V goes HAM and
blows da hell outta a bunch mo' government

00:03:57.609 --> 00:04:01.660
buildings, and shit gettin' closer to a full
on revolution in da streets.

00:04:01.669 --> 00:04:07.029
It's gettin' real, and Finch gotta find V
and put his ass in check. Fast. So how's he

00:04:07.029 --> 00:04:13.240
gonna find him? By dropping acid at Larkhill,
and trippin BALLZ til he can see inside V's head

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:13.920
DUH!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:19.280
Well turns out, it works- Finch's
eys open wide and he realize dat da only person

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:25.199
or thing that can keep you down is yo'self.
Then he finds V's secret swag pad and fills

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.240
him full of lead. But V survives for two reasons;

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.720
1. Cuz ideas are bulletproof

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:34.580
and 2. Cuz V's secret identity is 50 CENT!!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.220
Naw, I'm just playin. 
But he still FUCKED up

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:40.800
and eventually dies in Evey's arms. His last words are:

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.479
"You must discover whose face lies behind this

00:04:43.479 --> 00:04:45.889
mask, but you must never know my face."

00:04:45.889 --> 00:04:51.789
V ain't the only hustla lyin' in dirt tho.
Adam Susan gets one in the dome, and da whole

00:04:51.789 --> 00:04:57.050
damn city start tearin' itself apart. Afta'
some deep-ass soul searchin', Evey figgers

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:02.710
out V's last riddle, and slaps dat mask on
her own face. Then she tell dem angry mobs:

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:08.830
"Look, y'all. We ain't done. The world is
yours now, and we best rebuild. Don't fuck it up."

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:13.560
On her way back to the Batcave, she
picks up Dominic, who bout to get his ass whooped.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:19.440
After dat, Evey blows up da government's
main crib on Downing Street, and V's body with it.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:24.319
The graphic novel ends with Finch
rollin' solo outta da city, and da implication

00:05:24.319 --> 00:05:30.689
that Evey gonna train Dom to be the next V.
Can't kill an idea.... Amirite?

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:39.140
Even though dis graphic novel called V for
"Vendetta," dat V stand fo' way mo' than dat.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:43.890
Cept fo' definite and indefinite articles,
erry chapter title start with the letter V.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:52.060
V's got da name-game on lock too: V, Evey,
Velierie, Victoria Station. Plus, da latter V

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:57.400
looks like the Roman numeral 5, reppin not
only dat V was in Room 5 up at Larkhill,

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.760
but also gives a lil nod to the FIFTH of November.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:06.160
This OG is straight gangsta fo' mo' than just
his alliterative and repetitive flow:

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.740
V got mad style when he up on dat vengeance grind.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:13.000
When he roll up on the people
 dat did him back at Larkhill,

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.360
he don't jus' slap em up.  
He gives em a taste of they own medicine.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:23.270
Dude dehumanizes Prothero drivin' his ass
mad, kills Lilliman all church-style like

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:28.230
it's eucharist time, and uses a syringe to
kill surridge, who was slangin one of dem

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:30.130
thangs to experiment on peeps.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:34.770
V's Vendetta ain't just 'bout stickin it to
da people who fucked his shit up at Larkhill,

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:39.900
but also burnin' down da the ideology dat
created such a twisted-ass place, and such

00:06:39.909 --> 00:06:45.139
a messed up society. In da face of a system
dat got so much power dat errybody's balls

00:06:45.139 --> 00:06:51.080
pretty much in a vice, V start preachin da
opposite of authority: anarchy. Like V say:

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:56.099
"Authority allows two roles. The torturer
and the tortured; twists people into joyless

00:06:56.099 --> 00:06:59.969
mannequins that fear and hate, while culture
plunges into the abyss."

00:06:59.969 --> 00:07:04.749
But to V, anarchy don't mean "no order," it
just means no leaders-

00:07:04.749 --> 00:07:07.429
instead, ERRYBODY runs da show

00:07:07.429 --> 00:07:12.499
It's bout YOU callin' yo own shots,
showin' da world love, and refusin' to give

00:07:12.499 --> 00:07:15.579
up what nobody cain't take from ya: yo integrity.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:20.220
Like Evie learn from Valierie's letter up
in dat cell, even though yo integrity is just

00:07:20.229 --> 00:07:24.439
a small thing, it's the difference between
being free and bein' broken.

00:07:24.439 --> 00:07:29.689
"It was my integrity that was important. Is
that so selfish? It sells for so little, but

00:07:29.689 --> 00:07:33.469
it's all we have left in this place. It is
the very last inch of us…

00:07:33.469 --> 00:07:35.599
but within that inch we are free."

00:07:35.599 --> 00:07:40.330
Now one of the tightest things bout this book
is dat da relationship between Evie and V

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:45.560
ain't yo regular damsel in distress bullshit.
It's hella complex, which we peepin' in da

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:51.080
first pages of da text. We got panels juxtaposed
showing em doin da same things- like Evie

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:56.120
puttin on a dress while V puttin on his OJ
gloves, and both of them lookin at they similar

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:01.340
reflections in the mirror- cuz not only are
they bound by an idea, but it foreshadowin

00:08:01.349 --> 00:08:05.069
how she gonna eventually take up da mask.
V even say:

00:08:05.069 --> 00:08:10.700
"Anarchy wears two faces, both creator and
destroyer. Thus destroyers topple empires,

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:15.510
make a canvas of clean rubble where creators
then can build a better world."

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:20.270
But dat ain't to say V is all good fo' Evie.
If you get all biblical up in this hizzouse,

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:27.360
you can peep day Evie's name similar to Eve,
and let's not forget da dictator's name is ADAM Susan.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:32.260
And how did Adam and Eve get their
shit wrecked and their world turned upside down?

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:33.980
By bein tempted by the devil!

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:39.000
Mo' than once, V is actually compared to, or compares himself to, the devil:

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.320
"I am the devil, and I come to do the devil's work."

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:47.680
So with all this killin and blowin' shit up,
how is V any different from the people he hattin' on?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:51.580
A lotta people put V in the same
crew with other do-gooder "superheros".

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.000
Like Green Lantern

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.940
NO NOT THAT ONE!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.500
MY MAN! Yeah!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:00.440
But truth is, callin V good or bad is just
too simple.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:04.120
Matta' fact, V often associated with Adam Susan.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:08.140
We got panels juxtaposing
images of Susan talkin to da Fate Computer

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:14.010
with V addressing fine-ass Madame Justice.
Man, even their deaths play out similarly-

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:17.030
both get popped, and pretty much at the same time.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:20.220
If you ain't convinced yet, check how similar this shit is-

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:24.270
Susan actually give us the lowdown on why
he do what he do and says :

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:29.290
"The only freedom left to my people is the
freedom to starve. The freedom to die, the

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:34.310
freedom to live in a world of chaos. Should
I allow them that freedom? I think not.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.010
I think not."

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:41.160
And when Evey tryna figger out why V tortured
her and put her in a fake prison, he say:

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.800
"Because I love you. Because I want to set
you free."

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:49.980
Both of deez playa do some HARDCORE shit to
protect othas. Sayin dat V was a good dude

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:56.270
or a bad dude is just too simplistic. Yeah,
V was an idea- but he was also a human being,

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:01.880
which means we cain't just slap a label on
him. Like V himself say, we all got somethin'

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.940
special goin on inside us:

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:13.800
"Everybody is special. Everybody. Everybody
is a hero, a lover, a fool, a villain. Everybody…Everybody has their story to tell."

